  "description": "vLLM 클러스터 전반의 SLO·시스템·KV 캐시·워크로드 집계 뷰. 모델/가속기 필터 적용 가능.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [
    {
      "asDropdown": false,
      "icon": "external link",
      "includeVars": true,
      "keepTime": true,
      "tags": ["vllm"],
      "targetBlank": false,
      "title": "vLLM Per-Model Grid",
      "tooltip": "모델별 그리드 뷰",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/vllm-per-model"
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {"h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0},
      "id": 100,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "① SLO & Throughput",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"},
      "description": "Time-to-first-token p50/p95/p99 — 사용자 체감 첫 토큰 지연.",
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "s", "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"}}, "overrides": []},
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 1},
      "id": 1,
      "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull"]}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}},
      "targets": [
        {"expr": "histogram_quantile(${percentile:raw}, sum by (le${groupby:raw}) (rate(vllm:time_to_first_token_seconds_bucket{model=~\"$model\",accelerator=~\"$accelerator\"}[5m])))", "legendFormat": "${percentile:text} {{model}} ({{accelerator}})", "refId": "A"}
      ],
      "title": "TTFT (${percentile:text})",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"},
      "description": "Inter-token latency p50/p95/p99 — 스트리밍 시 토큰 간 지연.",
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "s", "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"}}, "overrides": []},
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 1},
      "id": 2,
      "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull"]}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}},
      "targets": [
        {"expr": "histogram_quantile(${percentile:raw}, sum by (le${groupby:raw}) (rate(vllm:inter_token_latency_seconds_bucket{model=~\"$model\",accelerator=~\"$accelerator\"}[5m])))", "legendFormat": "${percentile:text} {{model}} ({{accelerator}})", "refId": "A"}
      ],
      "title": "TPOT (${percentile:text})",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"},
      "description": "End-to-end 요청 지연 p50/p95/p99 — arrival → 최종 토큰.",
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "s", "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"}}, "overrides": []},
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 1},
      "id": 3,
      "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull"]}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}},
      "targets": [
        {"expr": "histogram_quantile(${percentile:raw}, sum by (le${groupby:raw}) (rate(vllm:e2e_request_latency_seconds_bucket{model=~\"$model\",accelerator=~\"$accelerator\"}[5m])))", "legendFormat": "${percentile:text} {{model}} ({{accelerator}})", "refId": "A"}
      ],
      "title": "E2E Request Latency (${percentile:text})",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"},
      "description": "Prompt(입력) 토큰 처리량 (tok/s). prefill 단계의 throughput.",
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "tps", "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"}}, "overrides": []},
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 9},
      "id": 4,
      "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max"]}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}},
      "targets": [
        {"expr": "sum by (__name__${groupby:raw}) (rate(vllm:prompt_tokens_total{model=~\"$model\",accelerator=~\"$accelerator\"}[1m]))", "legendFormat": "{{model}} ({{accelerator}})", "refId": "A"}
      ],
      "title": "Prompt Throughput (tok/s)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"},
      "description": "Generation(출력) 토큰 처리량 (tok/s). decode 단계의 throughput.",
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "tps", "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"}}, "overrides": []},
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 9},
      "id": 20,
      "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max"]}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}},
      "targets": [
        {"expr": "sum by (__name__${groupby:raw}) (rate(vllm:generation_tokens_total{model=~\"$model\",accelerator=~\"$accelerator\"}[1m]))", "legendFormat": "{{model}} ({{accelerator}})", "refId": "A"}
      ],
      "title": "Generation Throughput (tok/s)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"},
      "description": "요청 완료 rate (finished_reason 별).",
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "reqps", "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"}, "custom": {"stacking": {"mode": "normal", "group": "A"}}}, "overrides": []},
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 9},
      "id": 5,
      "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean"]}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}},
      "targets": [
        {"expr": "sum by (finished_reason${groupby:raw}) (rate(vllm:request_success_total{model=~\"$model\",accelerator=~\"$accelerator\"}[5m]))", "legendFormat": "{{finished_reason}} {{model}} ({{accelerator}})", "refId": "A"}
      ],
      "title": "Request Completion Rate by finished_reason",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {"h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 17},
      "id": 101,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "② System State",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"},
      "description": "Running + Waiting 요청 수 (stacked).",
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"}, "custom": {"stacking": {"mode": "normal", "group": "A"}, "fillOpacity": 30}}, "overrides": []},
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 18},
      "id": 6,
      "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max"]}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}},
      "targets": [
        {"expr": "sum by (__name__${groupby:raw}) (vllm:num_requests_running{model=~\"$model\",accelerator=~\"$accelerator\"})", "legendFormat": "running {{model}} ({{accelerator}})", "refId": "A"},
        {"expr": "sum by (__name__${groupby:raw}) (vllm:num_requests_waiting{model=~\"$model\",accelerator=~\"$accelerator\"})", "legendFormat": "waiting {{model}} ({{accelerator}})", "refId": "B"}
      ],
      "title": "Concurrency (Running + Waiting)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"},
      "description": "KV 캐시 사용률(avg/max) + waiting 큐 길이 보조선. 사용률이 높으면서 waiting 이 같이 오르면 실질 KV 압력.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {"unit": "percentunit", "min": 0, "max": 1, "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"}, "custom": {"fillOpacity": 10}},
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {"id": "byFrameRefID", "options": "C"},
            "properties": [
              {"id": "unit", "value": "short"},
              {"id": "custom.axisPlacement", "value": "right"},
              {"id": "custom.axisLabel", "value": "waiting"},
              {"id": "max", "value": null},
              {"id": "color", "value": {"mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "orange"}},
              {"id": "custom.lineStyle", "value": {"fill": "dash", "dash": [6, 4]}}
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 18},
      "id": 7,
      "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max"]}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}},
      "targets": [
        {"expr": "avg by (__name__${groupby:raw}) (vllm:kv_cache_usage_perc{model=~\"$model\",accelerator=~\"$accelerator\"})", "legendFormat": "avg {{model}} ({{accelerator}})", "refId": "A"},
        {"expr": "max by (__name__${groupby:raw}) (vllm:kv_cache_usage_perc{model=~\"$model\",accelerator=~\"$accelerator\"})", "legendFormat": "max {{model}} ({{accelerator}})", "refId": "B"},
        {"expr": "sum by (__name__${groupby:raw}) (vllm:num_requests_waiting{model=~\"$model\",accelerator=~\"$accelerator\"})", "legendFormat": "waiting {{model}} ({{accelerator}})", "refId": "C"}
      ],
      "title": "KV Cache Usage (avg / max) + Waiting",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"},
      "description": "요청 큐 대기 시간 p95.",
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "s", "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"}, "custom": {"fillOpacity": 10}}, "overrides": []},
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 26},
      "id": 8,
      "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"]}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}},
      "targets": [
        {"expr": "histogram_quantile(${percentile:raw}, sum by (le${groupby:raw}) (rate(vllm:request_queue_time_seconds_bucket{model=~\"$model\",accelerator=~\"$accelerator\"}[5m])))", "legendFormat": "queue ${percentile:text} {{model}} ({{accelerator}})", "refId": "A"}
      ],
      "title": "Queue Wait Time (${percentile:text})",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"},
      "description": "현재 활성 (model × accelerator) 배포 수.",
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "color": {"mode": "thresholds"}, "thresholds": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "blue", "value": null}]}}, "overrides": []},
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 26},
      "id": 10,
      "options": {"colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "justifyMode": "auto", "orientation": "auto", "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false}, "textMode": "auto"},
      "targets": [
        {"expr": "count(count by (model, accelerator) (vllm:num_requests_running{model=~\"$model\",accelerator=~\"$accelerator\"}))", "legendFormat": "deployments", "refId": "A"}
      ],
      "title": "Active Deployments",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {"h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 34},
      "id": 102,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "③ Prefix Cache",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"},
      "description": "Prefix cache hit rate + queries/sec 보조선. queries 가 0 이면 hit rate 빈 시리즈가 정상(트래픽 없음 또는 prefix caching 비활성).",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {"unit": "percentunit", "min": 0, "max": 1, "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"}, "custom": {"fillOpacity": 10}},
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {"id": "byFrameRefID", "options": "B"},
            "properties": [
              {"id": "unit", "value": "reqps"},
              {"id": "custom.axisPlacement", "value": "right"},
              {"id": "custom.axisLabel", "value": "queries/sec"},
              {"id": "max", "value": null},
              {"id": "color", "value": {"mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "blue"}},
              {"id": "custom.lineStyle", "value": {"fill": "dash", "dash": [6, 4]}}
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 35},
      "id": 11,
      "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "lastNotNull"]}, "tooltip": {"mode": "multi", "sort": "desc"}},
      "targets": [
        {"expr": "sum by (__name__${groupby:raw}) (rate(vllm:prefix_cache_hits{model=~\"$model\",accelerator=~\"$accelerator\"}[5m])) / sum by (__name__${groupby:raw}) (rate(vllm:prefix_cache_queries{model=~\"$model\",accelerator=~\"$accelerator\"}[5m]))", "legendFormat": "hit rate {{model}} ({{accelerator}})", "refId": "A"},
        {"expr": "sum by (__name__${groupby:raw}) (rate(vllm:prefix_cache_queries{model=~\"$model\",accelerator=~\"$accelerator\"}[5m]))", "legendFormat": "queries/sec {{model}} ({{accelerator}})", "refId": "B"}
      ],
      "title": "Prefix Cache Hit Rate + Queries/sec",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {"h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 43},
      "id": 103,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "④ Workload Characteristics",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"},
      "description": "Prompt 토큰 길이 분포.",
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "custom": {"hideFrom": {"tooltip": false, "viz": false, "legend": false}, "scaleDistribution": {"type": "linear"}}}, "overrides": []},
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 44},
      "id": 15,
      "options": {"calculate": false, "cellGap": 1, "color": {"exponent": 0.5, "fill": "dark-orange", "mode": "scheme", "reverse": false, "scale": "exponential", "scheme": "Greens", "steps": 64}, "exemplars": {"color": "rgba(255,0,255,0.7)"}, "filterValues": {"le": 1e-9}, "legend": {"show": true}, "rowsFrame": {"layout": "auto"}, "tooltip": {"show": true, "yHistogram": false}, "yAxis": {"axisPlacement": "left", "reverse": false, "unit": "short"}},
      "targets": [
        {"expr": "sum by (le${groupby:raw}) (rate(vllm:request_prompt_tokens_bucket{model=~\"$model\",accelerator=~\"$accelerator\"}[5m]))", "format": "heatmap", "legendFormat": "{{le}} {{model}} ({{accelerator}})", "refId": "A"}
      ],
      "title": "Prompt Token Length Distribution",
      "type": "heatmap"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"},
      "description": "Generation 토큰 길이 분포.",
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "custom": {"hideFrom": {"tooltip": false, "viz": false, "legend": false}, "scaleDistribution": {"type": "linear"}}}, "overrides": []},
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 44},
      "id": 16,
      "options": {"calculate": false, "cellGap": 1, "color": {"exponent": 0.5, "fill": "dark-orange", "mode": "scheme", "reverse": false, "scale": "exponential", "scheme": "Reds", "steps": 64}, "exemplars": {"color": "rgba(255,0,255,0.7)"}, "filterValues": {"le": 1e-9}, "legend": {"show": true}, "rowsFrame": {"layout": "auto"}, "tooltip": {"show": true, "yHistogram": false}, "yAxis": {"axisPlacement": "left", "reverse": false, "unit": "short"}},
      "targets": [
        {"expr": "sum by (le${groupby:raw}) (rate(vllm:request_generation_tokens_bucket{model=~\"$model\",accelerator=~\"$accelerator\"}[5m]))", "format": "heatmap", "legendFormat": "{{le}} {{model}} ({{accelerator}})", "refId": "A"}
      ],
      "title": "Generation Token Length Distribution",
      "type": "heatmap"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"},
      "description": "finished_reason 별 비율.",
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "percentunit", "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"}}, "overrides": []},
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 52},
      "id": 17,
      "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "list", "placement": "right", "values": ["percent"]}, "pieType": "donut", "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["sum"], "fields": "", "values": false}, "tooltip": {"mode": "single", "sort": "none"}},
      "targets": [
        {"expr": "sum by (finished_reason${groupby:raw}) (increase(vllm:request_success_total{model=~\"$model\",accelerator=~\"$accelerator\"}[$__range]))", "legendFormat": "{{finished_reason}} {{model}} ({{accelerator}})", "refId": "A"}
      ],
      "title": "Finish Reason Ratio",
      "type": "piechart"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"},
      "description": "가속기별 generation 토큰 처리량 점유율.",
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "tps", "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"}}, "overrides": []},
      "gridPos": {"h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 52},
      "id": 18,
      "options": {"legend": {"displayMode": "list", "placement": "right", "values": ["value", "percent"]}, "pieType": "donut", "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["mean"], "fields": "", "values": false}, "tooltip": {"mode": "single", "sort": "none"}},
      "targets": [
        {"expr": "sum by (accelerator) (rate(vllm:generation_tokens_total{model=~\"$model\",accelerator=~\"$accelerator\"}[5m]))", "legendFormat": "{{accelerator}}", "refId": "A"}
      ],
      "title": "Throughput Share by Accelerator",
      "type": "piechart"
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "30s",
